OL,3,GNEWSASwimming pool reopens after #4.25m
OL,4,Ainvestment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA swimming pool in Lancashire,
OL,7,Fdescribed by swimmers as "brilliant",
OL,8,Fhas reopened after #4.25m of council
OL,9,Ffunding.
OL,11,FThe Ribblesdale Pool in Clitheroe had
OL,12,Fbeen shut for six months for what Simon
OL,13,FHore, Leader of Ribble Valley Borough
OL,14,FCouncil called a "significant
OL,15,Frefurbishment".
OL,17,FRichenda Ratcliffe has been swimming
OL,18,Fregularly at the pool for the last 35
OL,19,Fyears, something she said "benefits her
OL,20,Flife fully" as it helps her manage her
OL,21,Farthiritis.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
