OL,3,GNEWSASwimming pool reopens after #4.25m
OL,4,Ainvestment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pool, home to the Clitheroe
OL,7,FDolphins swimming team, has been open
OL,8,Fsince 9 November, with a reopening
OL,9,Fceremony planned for Saturday.
